### Step 1: learn Fineract's API by hand. Basic auth mifos:password, tenant "default".
@host = http://localhost:8443/fineract-provider/api/v1
@auth = Basic bWlmb3M6cGFzc3dvcmQ=

### Health
GET http://localhost:8443/fineract-provider/actuator/health

### Create a client (customer)
POST {{host}}/clients
Authorization: {{auth}}
Fineract-Platform-TenantId: default
Content-Type: application/json

{"officeId":1,"legalFormId":1,"firstname":"Test","lastname":"User","active":true,
 "activationDate":"01 January 2026","submittedOnDate":"01 January 2026",
 "dateFormat":"dd MMMM yyyy","locale":"en"}

### List savings products (create one first via /savingsproducts if empty)
GET {{host}}/savingsproducts
Authorization: {{auth}}
Fineract-Platform-TenantId: default

